## Rules

- First determine whether the active change already has an applicable issue.
- Retain and use an applicable existing issue.
- Only when no applicable issue exists, ask whether to create, link, or proceed
  without one.
- Use an available {{provider}} integration when the user chooses to create or
  link an issue; otherwise ask the user how to proceed.

## Rationale

A selected tracker enables issue handling without requiring an issue for every
change or creating duplicate records.
